        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145540,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impariamo a scrivere istruzioni condizionali che gestiscono condizioni specifiche, come nell'interfaccia di gioco qui sotto.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;stateImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;state&quot;&gt;Exploring&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Player Health: &lt;span id=&quot;hp&quot;&gt;60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt; 0 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;100&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 100 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    const hp = document.getElementById(&quot;hp&quot;);&#xA;    hp.textContent = value;&#xA;    const image = document.getElementById(&quot;stateImage&quot;);&#xA;    const state = document.getElementById(&quot;state&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 20) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Critical Health&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 50) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;In Danger&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 80) {&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Exploring&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 100) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Powered Up&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Full Health&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145541,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando sposti il cursore, questa interfaccia di gioco usa istruzioni condizionali per mostrare diversi stati del giocatore se la salute è inferiore a determinati valori.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&quot;stateImage&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542751371-adc38448a05e?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2850&amp;q=80&quot;&#xA;   height=&quot;200px&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 id=&quot;state&quot;&gt;Exploring&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Player Health: &lt;span id=&quot;hp&quot;&gt;60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt; 0 &lt;input id=&quot;slider&quot;&#xA;   type=&quot;range&quot; min=&quot;0&quot; max=&quot;100&quot; oninput=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&#xA;   onchange=&quot;slide(this.value)&quot;&gt; 100 &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   function slide(value) {&#xA;    const hp = document.getElementById(&quot;hp&quot;);&#xA;    hp.textContent = value;&#xA;    const image = document.getElementById(&quot;stateImage&quot;);&#xA;    const state = document.getElementById(&quot;state&quot;);&#xA;    if (value &lt; 20) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-night.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Critical Health&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 50) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-evening.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;In Danger&quot;;&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 80) {&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Exploring&quot;;&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-afternoon.png&quot;);&#xA;    } else if (value &lt; 100) {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/good-morning.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Powered Up&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     image.setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, &quot;https://mimo.app/i/ride-and-shine.png&quot;);&#xA;     state.textContent = &quot;Full Health&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145542,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usando le istruzioni if e else, possiamo scrivere un programma che mostra un messaggio se <code>health &lt; 50</code> è <code>true</code> e un altro se è <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"35\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is in danger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is doing fine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>health</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;</code> e infine <code>50</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145543,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per una condizione più specifica, ad esempio se <code>health</code> non è minore di <code>50</code> ma è minore di <code>80</code>, possiamo scrivere invece <code>else if (health &lt; 80)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(health &gt; 200)\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is in danger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is exploring&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>else</code>, seguito da <code>if</code> e infine <code>(health &lt; 80)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145544,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiamiamo questa un'<strong>istruzione else if</strong>. Questa istruzione esegue il suo blocco di codice se la condizione precedente è <code>false</code> e <code>health &lt; 80</code> è <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is in danger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is exploring&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>health</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;</code> e infine <code>80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145545,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo programmare un'istruzione <code>else</code> per eseguire il suo blocco di codice quando le condizioni <code>if</code> e <code>else if</code> sono <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(health &lt; 100)\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"142\" /><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"144\" /><option startIndex=\"183\" endIndex=\"184\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is in danger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is exploring&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is powered up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>else</code>, seguito da <code>{</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145546,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Finché vengono prima dell'istruzione <code>else</code>, possiamo aggiungere tutte le istruzioni <code>else if</code> che vogliamo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"142\" /><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"145\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"85\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is in danger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is exploring&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt; \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is powered up&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player is at full health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>else</code>, seguito da <code>if</code> e poi <code>else</code>, <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145547,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemies &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Few enemies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemies &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy wave incoming&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Enemy wave incoming</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Few enemies</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Enemy wave incoming</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145548,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt; \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &amp;&amp; score &lt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level cleared!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Perfect clear!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Level cleared!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Perfettamente chiaro!</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Level cleared!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145549,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa succede quando le condizioni dell'istruzione <code>if</code> e delle istruzioni <code>else if</code> restituiscono <code>false</code>?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Perfect clear!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (score &gt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Great run!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Try again!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il blocco di codice dell'istruzione <code>else</code> viene eseguito</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non succede nulla</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il blocco di codice dell'istruzione <code>else</code> viene eseguito.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145550,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il numero massimo di istruzioni <code>else if</code> che possiamo aggiungere a un'istruzione <code>if</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non esiste un numero massimo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non esiste un numero massimo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145551,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Visualizza un messaggio nella console quando <code>level</code> è maggiore di <code>12</code> ma minore di <code>17</code> scrivendo un'istruzione <code>else if</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"136\" endIndex=\"137\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &lt;= \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tutorial zone&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Mid-game challenge unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (level &gt;= \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Endgame unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>else</code>, seguito da <code>if</code> e poi <code>(level &lt; 17)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145552,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi le parole chiave per un'istruzione <code>else if</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"109\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"&quot;healthPotion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (item === \" /><text value=\"&quot;legendarySword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Equip legendary sword.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (item === \" /><text value=\"&quot;healthPotion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Use health potion.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>else if</code>.</p></body></html>"
